          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP-563 Cache Lake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Found with Team 7Up which is me, cailloupot, Boombear, Kiwibirdman, fuzeebear, WillowZilla, and  SigShark. We were on a 24 hour caching run to the Cold Lake area and WillowZilla insisted that we stop for this cap because of the name. We fumbled around in the dark for a few minutes when someone shone a light in the right spot. That was the obvious GZ, and we were correct.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
