          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP-563 Cache Lake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Found with Team 7Up which included Kiwibirdman, fuzeebear, Willowzilla, Janski, Ninja Fairies, Cailloupot. This was a part of a day where I upped my single day caching record, getting to 354 in one day, including 150 FTFs. TFTC.&lt;/p&gt;

